    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIAtr">VII Atr</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et constituerunt inprimis Dei misericordiam et auxilium invocare ieiuniis, elemosinis, confessione et abstinentia á malefactis et iniustitia.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And they agreed first of all to invoke the mercy and help of God by fasts and almsgiving, by confession, and by abstaining from misdeeds and injustice.</ab>
